COMMENT ON COLUMN public.validation_evidence.detection_status IS 'Did any control/sensor observe this validation? Distinct question from outcome (which answers "is the exposure still reachable"). no_telemetry_source means UNKNOWN — absence of telemetry is a configuration gap, never proof a control failed.';


